<title>USA: DVI files for $100 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>DVI files for $100 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>DVI Inc filed Friday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $100 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>The Doylestown, Pa.,-based finance company said net proceeds from the offering will be used for general corporate purposes, including expansion and diversification of its financing activities.</p>
<p>DVI specializes in financing acquisiton of sophisticated medical equipment such as those used for diagnostic imaging and radiation therapy.</p>
</text>
